<title>GERMANY: German engineering orders fall 18 pct in August.</title>
<headline>German engineering orders fall 18 pct in August.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>German engineering orders fell by 18 percent in real terms in August from August 1995, the engineering industry association VDMA said.</p>
<p>In the June to August period orders were six percent below the same 1995 period. The VDMA statement gave the following data</p>
<p>    August	 change in pct  June-Aug  change in pct</p>
<p>    overall	    -18	 overall		-6</p>
<p>    of which German  -20	 of which German    -8</p>
<p>		 foreign -16	 foreign		-3</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom + 49 69 756525</p>
